*Glacier Work*

A lady on her first visit to Yellowstone National Park said to her
guide, "Look at all those big rocks.  Wherever did they come from?"

"The glaciers brought them down," said the guide.

"But where are the glaciers?" The lady asked.

"The glaciers," said the guide in a weary voice, "have gone back for
more rocks."

